      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Daemon of Slaanesh" id="92c0-6864-b67a-d069" hidden="false">
          <description>Daemons of Slaanesh have the Daemon, Fleet, Hatred (Daemons of Khorne) and Rending special rules. In addition, units composed entirely of Daemons of Slaanesh run an additional 3&quot; (this will normally be D6+3&quot;). Units that are entirely composed of Cavalry models instead Run an additional D6&quot;. Vehicles that are not Walkers move an extra 3&quot; whenever they move Flat Out instead.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
