        <rule name="Daemon of Tzeentch" id="d44f-e23e-352b-b086" hidden="false">
          <description>Daemons of Tzeentch have the Daemon and Hatred (Daemons of Nurgle) special rules. When manifesting psychic powers, Daemons of Tzeentch have a +3 modifier to their Leadership. In addition, Daemons of Tzeentch re-roll all saving throw results of 1.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
