            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model, and all models in its unit, re-roll failed To Hit rolls in close combat. In addition, challenges issued by this model cannot be refused, and the challenge must be accepted by a model of your choice, not your opponent&apos;s.</characteristic>
