          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If the Daemon bearing this Gift is involved in a fight which results in a draw, its side counts as having won by one wound.  If both side include an Instrument of Chaos, the result remians a draw.</characteristic>
