        <rule name="Formless Horror" id="35cd-8199-0beb-f616" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>At the start of each Fight sub-phase, the Changeling may choose a single non-vehicle enemy model in base contact and change any or all of his WS, S, T, I, and/or A characteristics to match those of the chosen foe, until the end of the current turn.</description>
