            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight sub-phase, after any challenges have been issued and accepted but before any blows are struck, any model involved in a challenge with the bearer must roll 3D6 and subtract their Ld from the total. That model suffers a penalty to its WS an I equal to the result (to a minimum of 1) for the rest of the phase.</characteristic>
